From: Zoltan HERPAI <wigyori@uid0.hu>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2020 09:58:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: orangepi-one-plus: enable PWM

Enable the PWM controller on the Orange Pi One Plus.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h6-orangepi-one-plus.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h6-orangepi-one-plus.dts
@@ -41,3 +41,7 @@
 		reg = <1>;
 	};
 };
+
+&pwm {
+	status = "okay";
+};
